request.problem:
(10分)已知$f(x) = |ax + 1|(a \in R)$,不等式$f(x) \le 3$的解集为$\left\{x| -2 \le x \le 1\right\}$.
(1)求a的值;
(2)若$|f(x) - 2f(\frac{x}{2})| \le k$恒成立,求k的取值范围.

